{'symbol': 'LDOS', 'date': '2022-10-10 08:00:00', 'title': 'LEIDOS PARTNERSHIP LAUNCHES NEW REVENUE CYCLE CAPABILITY FOR DOD EHR', 'text': 'TEAM SUCCESSFULLY DEPLOYS MHS GENESIS TO 18 ADDITIONAL MILITARY COMMANDS IN LATEST WAVE RESTON, VA. , OCT. 10, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE LEIDOS PARTNERSHIP FOR DEFENSE HEALTH (LPDH) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT SUCCESSFULLY DELIVERED THE MHS GENESIS ELECTRONIC HEALTH RECORD TO AN ADDITIONAL 10,000 CLINICIANS AND PROVIDERS AS PART OF ITS LATEST DOUBLE WAVE DEPLOYMENT (WAVES JACKSONVILLE/EGLIN), SPANNING 18 NEW MILITARY TREATMENT FACILITY COMMANDS IN ALABAMA, FLORIDA, GEORGIA, TENNESSEE, MISSISSIPPI AND SOUTH CAROLINA.'}